+ ArrayBuilder'Item'Backing is Tuple
    - Backing = GCBacking
    - Backing is StorageBacking
    is Indexable'Item
    is Inspectable

_ header CPointer'Byte
_ context Backing.Context

────────────────────
+ This
    - Backing = GCBacking

= This(GCBacking.allocate'ArrayBuilderHeader(Void(), 1) as CPointer'Byte, Void())

────────────────────
+ This'Storage
    - storage Storage
    - Storage is ArrayStorageProvider
    - Backing = Storage.Backing'Item
    - Backing is StorageBacking

. context = storage as Backing.Context
= This(Backing.allocate'ArrayBuilderHeader(context, 1) as CPointer'Byte, context)

────────────────────
+ to String

", ".join(this as <Item>)

