────────────────────
+ get length Size

current-size

────────────────────
+ get mark Size

current-size

────────────────────
_ get current-items Array'Item'Backing

Array'Item'Backing((header as CPointer'(CPointer'Item))[0], ((header + 8) as CPointer'Size)[0])

────────────────────
_ get current-size Size

((header + 16) as CPointer'Size)[0]

